      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "pktito's mascot, a budgie beside a speech bubble and a transcript"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "about_models": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NVIDIA's [parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v2](https://huggingface.co/nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v2) and [-v3](https://huggingface.co/nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3), under [CC BY 4.0](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/), modified by pktito (partly quantized to int8). Provided as is, without warranties. pktito is not affiliated with or endorsed by NVIDIA."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "about_open": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "comment": "About (about.*); the strings in CDATA are HTML, as the desktop's *_html are, for AnnotatedString.fromHtml",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "About pktito"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "about_privacy": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Privacy"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "about_silero": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voice activity detection, [MIT](https://github.com/snakers4/silero-vad/blob/master/LICENSE)\nCopyright (c) 2020-present Silero Team"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "about_tagline": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "comment": "the name's sound in one piece, a word joiner (&#8288;) after each of its hyphens: the desktop's broke \"pick-a-\" from \"tito\" at one width (the layout audit, 2026-11-01). Its space can still break: at twice the text size the whole of it is 310 dp (Archivo's advances, 15 sp at 27 dp), and a folded phone's cover has 305 for the words",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A compact Parakeet implementation *(pronounced “pick-⁠a-⁠tito”)*\nSpeech to text on this device."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "about_version": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Version %1$@ · %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "app_name": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "comment": "The desktop's words where the screen is the desktop's (ui/locales/en.json, by the key in each comment); Android's own where it differs.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "pktito"
